1
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:58,640
We lost 300 ryo, thanks 
to your meddling.

2
00:00:58,810 --> 00:01:01,440
We won't go back empty-handed.

3
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:04,900
If your hands are so 
empty, will you hold this?

4
00:01:33,180 --> 00:01:36,300
Is it true they hired you 
for only twenty ryo?

5
00:01:36,430 --> 00:01:37,390
Yes.

6
00:01:38,180 --> 00:01:42,270
The sword we stole was a treasure 
given to them by the Shogun.

7
00:01:42,390 --> 00:01:46,400
And they'll only pay 
twenty to get it back?

8
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,320
Ridiculous!

9
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:51,740
They're a poor, small clan.

10
00:01:51,860 --> 00:01:55,410
Trying to swindle 300 ryo for 
a sword is asking too much.

11
00:01:57,320 --> 00:01:59,410
Shut up! Damn you!

12
00:02:02,830 --> 00:02:05,210
Looks like a nasty 
storm's brewing...

13
00:02:05,370 --> 00:02:07,040
Can't waste my time here!

14
00:02:09,340 --> 00:02:14,340
Ninja Scroll

15
00:03:19,870 --> 00:03:21,910
Oh, I'm sorry for you.

16
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:24,160
That was one hell of a storm!

17
00:03:24,160 --> 00:03:27,160
That's right! My roof got blown 
off and scared my wife so bad...

18
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:28,960
...that she went into labor.

19
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,630
It was really something.

20
00:03:30,750 --> 00:03:33,000
That's your seventh kid, right?

21
00:03:33,130 --> 00:03:34,500
Nope, the ninth.

22
00:03:34,630 --> 00:03:37,630
Whoa! You must really 
love your wife!

23
00:03:39,430 --> 00:03:43,220
Isn't that Sakichi's daughter 
from Shimoda Village?

24
00:03:44,260 --> 00:03:46,220
What's with her?

25
00:03:51,860 --> 00:03:53,230
What's wrong?!

26
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:01,240
All... dead...

27
00:04:02,530 --> 00:04:05,080
Everybody's dead.

28
00:04:05,660 --> 00:04:07,450
Dead?!

29
00:04:07,580 --> 00:04:11,710
Plague... Plague did it...

30
00:04:17,050 --> 00:04:18,670
My god !

31
00:04:19,130 --> 00:04:22,140
This area's off limits! 
No one goes through!

32
00:04:22,140 --> 00:04:25,810
This road's closed until 
the epidemic is over.

33
00:04:25,970 --> 00:04:28,180
Epidemic?! The hell with that!

34
00:04:30,850 --> 00:04:31,730
What is it?

35
00:04:31,730 --> 00:04:35,520
Sir, my scout saw a 
strange group of men

36
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:39,700
ride toward Shimoda 
Village late last night.

37
00:04:40,860 --> 00:04:43,160
It might have something 
to do with this

38
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:45,660
epidemic so I came to 
tell you, Chamberlain.

39
00:04:45,700 --> 00:04:51,290
Meaning what? That they spread a plague 
as they passed through the village?

40
00:04:51,420 --> 00:04:53,880
Ridiculous! Why 
would they do that?

41
00:04:54,710 --> 00:04:56,380
Something's fishy.

42
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:58,340
Let it alone.

43
00:05:02,430 --> 00:05:04,260
On second thought, we can't.

44
00:05:04,260 --> 00:05:06,760
This is the order to 
all of you Koga ninja.

45
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:09,850
Go to Shimoda Village and 
find what really happened.

46
00:05:09,980 --> 00:05:10,890
Sir!

47
00:05:10,890 --> 00:05:14,190
One more thing. If any of 
your people get infected...

48
00:05:15,230 --> 00:05:16,820
Understood, sir.

49
00:05:17,650 --> 00:05:19,820
The first group will follow the 
Shirakawa River from the north.

50
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:23,200
The second will cross 
Taro Pass from the west.

51
00:05:23,200 --> 00:05:26,200
You'll reach Shimoda Village 
in about an hour. Understand?

52
00:05:26,740 --> 00:05:30,870
Hikoza saw them. There were only eight. 
No match for us.

53
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:33,870
Our real enemy is this epidemic.

54
00:05:35,170 --> 00:05:36,630
True.

55
00:05:47,430 --> 00:05:48,390
Kagero...

56
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:59,070
You intend to leave 
me behind, Hanza?

57
00:05:59,820 --> 00:06:02,860
You have your own 
duties, don't you?

58
00:06:02,860 --> 00:06:06,110
Poison tasting is very important. 
Don't forget that.

59
00:06:06,780 --> 00:06:11,080
While our lord is away from his 
domain, the work isn't necessary.

60
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:13,710
Until he returns...

61
00:06:13,710 --> 00:06:15,080
I am one of the Koga ninja!

62
00:06:16,540 --> 00:06:18,090
I cannot take you.

63
00:06:18,540 --> 00:06:21,090
You could all be 
killed out there.

64
00:06:21,090 --> 00:06:25,430
How can I just sit and 
wait here alone?!

65
00:06:41,730 --> 00:06:45,900
Kagero's gotten even 
more beautiful.

66
00:06:45,900 --> 00:06:48,120
All the more reason to pity her.

67
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:50,700
It's her destiny. 
She must hate it.

68
00:06:51,330 --> 00:06:54,330
Enough. Where are 
Hikoza and the others?

69
00:06:54,330 --> 00:06:57,290
They were right behind us. 
I'll have a look.

70
00:07:12,640 --> 00:07:14,430
Hey! What are you doing?

71
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:20,020
What the...?!

72
00:07:47,220 --> 00:07:48,430
There!

73
00:08:10,280 --> 00:08:11,280
Shit!

74
00:08:21,460 --> 00:08:22,790
Tessai!

75
00:08:27,670 --> 00:08:29,340
You are indeed a sorry sight.

76
00:08:30,930 --> 00:08:32,340
Shall we go?

77
00:08:45,400 --> 00:08:47,570
Who was that freak?

78
00:08:48,820 --> 00:08:51,360
Forget it. I don't want 
to see him again, anyway.

79
00:08:52,410 --> 00:08:56,620
I'm grateful to you. I am 
Kagero of the Koga ninja.

80
00:08:57,950 --> 00:09:01,290
Jubei. Kibagami Jubei.

81
00:09:02,500 --> 00:09:05,670
The town of Kakio is to the west. 
Our paths part here.

82
00:09:56,180 --> 00:09:57,510
Oh, hi...

83
00:09:59,560 --> 00:10:02,180
I know the way now, so...

84
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:07,110
Ow...

85
00:10:07,110 --> 00:10:10,690
Okay, I got it. Are we done now?

86
00:10:11,610 --> 00:10:15,030
There's no reason we 
should kill each other.

87
00:10:19,330 --> 00:10:21,120
If you're not going to end this... 
I will!

88
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:24,160
Like hell!

89
00:10:34,220 --> 00:10:38,390
Strange skill you have. But 
it can't hurt my body.

90
00:10:40,100 --> 00:10:41,060
Seems that way.

91
00:10:55,490 --> 00:10:59,410
What's wrong, Monster? Your 
skin's starting to crumble!

92
00:11:02,580 --> 00:11:03,870
Die!

93
00:11:28,650 --> 00:11:30,770
Splendid !

94
00:11:30,770 --> 00:11:34,230
Your sword flew swift 
as the wind itself and

95
00:11:34,230 --> 00:11:37,570
slashed your enemy like 
a cyclone's touch.

96
00:11:38,860 --> 00:11:42,620
He was no match for you. 
Why don't you join me?

97
00:11:42,620 --> 00:11:47,460
Your skills will be of great help 
for me to fight the likes of him.

98
00:11:48,080 --> 00:11:52,630
You're joking. Who'd want to 
fight a monster like him again?

99
00:11:53,670 --> 00:11:56,630
You'll have to. They 
won't leave you alone.

100
00:11:56,630 --> 00:12:00,720
You just killed one of the 
Eight Devils of Kimon.

101
00:12:02,260 --> 00:12:06,270
You didn't beat him 
by yourself, though.

102
00:12:07,680 --> 00:12:12,190
That Koga ninja woman... 
Interesting technique she uses.

103
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:32,670
Lord Genma. All is 
proceeding as planned.

104
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:43,430
It arrives from the Shogun of the 
Dark by six tomorrow evening.

105
00:12:44,640 --> 00:12:48,810
Very well. Write 
to him in return.

106
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:55,360
"We return in three days. There's 
nothing to worry about."

107
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:56,940
At once.

108
00:13:41,780 --> 00:13:45,410
Where are you headed?

109
00:13:46,700 --> 00:13:49,370
No place in particular. You?

110
00:13:49,990 --> 00:13:56,040
I'm looking for somebody, and you 
look exactly like him, so...

111
00:13:56,750 --> 00:14:00,760
Strangers can look alike. I'm 
Kibagami Jubei, a wanderer...

112
00:14:13,230 --> 00:14:15,060
It was most certainly your face.

113
00:14:15,400 --> 00:14:19,320
Tessai was able to make 
an impression of it.

114
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:37,790
Just leave me the hell alone!

115
00:14:46,630 --> 00:14:48,760
A cast-off skin.

116
00:14:48,760 --> 00:14:52,220
She shed it like a 
snake and escaped.

117
00:14:54,310 --> 00:14:56,980
A gang of freaks, one and all.

118
00:14:59,190 --> 00:15:03,650
You've no obligation. I just 
didn't want you to die yet.

119
00:15:04,610 --> 00:15:06,950
Who are these Eight 
Devils of Kimon?

120
00:15:07,910 --> 00:15:10,070
A group of ninja who work 
for the Shogun of the Dark.

121
00:15:10,070 --> 00:15:12,040
You know of the 
Shogun of the Dark?

122
00:15:11,700 --> 00:15:15,120
He wants to rebuild the Toyotomi 
clan, the former rulers of Japan.

123
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:19,460
He has 16 lords behind him and is 
trying to expand his influence.

124
00:15:19,460 --> 00:15:22,630
The most dangerous enemy 
of the Tokugawa Shogunate.

125
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:27,090
His power is supported in the 
shadows by the Eight Devils.

126
00:15:27,090 --> 00:15:29,640
What are they up to 
here in Mochizuki?

127
00:15:30,680 --> 00:15:34,020
That's what I came here to find out. 
It's a tough job.

128
00:15:35,520 --> 00:15:38,690
Why don't you work for 
me, for 100 ryo?

129
00:15:39,730 --> 00:15:42,650
A Tokugawa spy wants 
to hire a ninja?

130
00:15:44,320 --> 00:15:46,820
I'm afraid I have no choice. 
It's an emergency.

131
00:15:46,820 --> 00:15:50,240
Only I managed to make 
it here to Mochizuki.

132
00:15:50,530 --> 00:15:53,120
The Eight Devils killed everyone 
else in my party on our way here.

133
00:15:53,120 --> 00:15:55,750
I need your help by all means!

134
00:15:56,750 --> 00:15:59,750
You'll never get away from them.

135
00:15:59,750 --> 00:16:02,090
You'll have to fight 
them sooner or later.

136
00:16:02,090 --> 00:16:05,300
Join me. You can kill two 
birds with one stone, right?

137
00:16:05,880 --> 00:16:09,760
I don't think so. Now why don't 
you just leave me alone?

138
00:16:12,390 --> 00:16:14,720
I see. Too bad.

139
00:16:15,520 --> 00:16:17,430
Such a pity...

140
00:16:20,060 --> 00:16:24,520
You'll lose your precious life.

141
00:16:24,980 --> 00:16:26,110
You're stubborn.

142
00:16:26,610 --> 00:16:30,200
No, what I speak of is literally of 
life or death importance to you.

143
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:34,740
You see, that shuriken 
was poisoned.

144
00:16:34,740 --> 00:16:37,290
It won't kill you instantly, 
but in a day and a

145
00:16:37,290 --> 00:16:40,080
night, when it starts to 
work, nothing can stop it.

146
00:16:41,710 --> 00:16:46,170
Unless you get the antidote. 
And only I know what it is.

147
00:16:46,170 --> 00:16:49,010
Work for me and I'll tell 
you the antidote along

148
00:16:49,010 --> 00:16:51,470
with the hundred ryo 
when the job is done.

149
00:16:52,640 --> 00:16:54,510
You're bluffing.

150
00:17:00,020 --> 00:17:01,690
I speak the truth.

151
00:17:01,690 --> 00:17:05,610
Tell me now. What's 
the antidote?

152
00:17:05,610 --> 00:17:09,820
Not until you work for me. Kill 
me and you've killed yourself!

153
00:17:15,580 --> 00:17:17,490
Now you'll need the 
antidote for yourself.

154
00:17:17,990 --> 00:17:20,960
Poor boy... You've 
so much to learn.

155
00:17:20,960 --> 00:17:23,750
That isn't the one that hit you.

156
00:17:24,460 --> 00:17:27,090
I threw THAT one away.

157
00:17:30,380 --> 00:17:31,220
Shit!

158
00:17:32,260 --> 00:17:36,800
Kibagami Jubei... You've lost... 
amateur!

159
00:17:38,140 --> 00:17:41,560
My name is Dakuan. 
How do you do?

160
00:17:46,230 --> 00:17:47,230
So, Benisato...

161
00:17:47,230 --> 00:17:51,740
This man, Kibagami Jubei, is a 
remnant of the Shogunate's spies?

162
00:17:52,360 --> 00:17:53,700
Possibly.

163
00:17:53,700 --> 00:17:55,740
Why didn't you kill him?

164
00:17:55,910 --> 00:17:57,490
Someone interfered.

165
00:17:57,490 --> 00:17:58,740
No excuses!

166
00:18:01,950 --> 00:18:06,080
If he's a government spy, 
he'll show up here soon.

167
00:18:06,380 --> 00:18:08,130
Be sure to kill him this time.

168
00:18:08,590 --> 00:18:10,630
I don't need your 
advice to do that.

169
00:18:15,590 --> 00:18:17,140
Jubei...

170
00:18:17,550 --> 00:18:21,520
There's something 
I've been wondering.

171
00:18:22,230 --> 00:18:25,350
Are you, by chance, the 
ninja who killed the chief

172
00:18:25,350 --> 00:18:28,270
retainers of the Yamashiro 
clan five years ago?

173
00:18:29,190 --> 00:18:32,780
He was supposedly a master 
swordsman, like you.

174
00:18:35,820 --> 00:18:38,700
The retainers had 
gorged themselves with

175
00:18:38,700 --> 00:18:41,870
gold they secretly dug 
out of a hidden mine.

176
00:18:42,120 --> 00:18:45,710
The ninja must have killed 
them by order of the lord

177
00:18:45,710 --> 00:18:47,380
who wanted to report the 
mine to the government.

178
00:18:47,380 --> 00:18:51,300
Because if the government found 
the hidden gold mine first...

179
00:18:51,300 --> 00:18:53,210
the lord would have 
lost his fief.

180
00:18:53,920 --> 00:18:58,470
But does that ninja know that after 
the retainers were killed...

181
00:18:58,470 --> 00:19:01,060
the government received 
no report about the mine?

182
00:19:01,890 --> 00:19:03,020
Why?

183
00:19:03,020 --> 00:19:08,650
If a government spy like you knows all 
that, then why don't you do something?

184
00:19:09,400 --> 00:19:14,320
No... Even the government can't 
move without definite evidence.

185
00:19:14,320 --> 00:19:17,450
Our spies tried many 
times to infiltrate the

186
00:19:17,450 --> 00:19:20,830
clan to find evidence, 
but none returned alive.

187
00:19:20,990 --> 00:19:22,370
The Shogun of the Dark...

188
00:19:22,370 --> 00:19:25,660
He stopped them by 
using the Kimon ninja.

189
00:19:26,460 --> 00:19:29,750
Why is the Shogun of the Dark 
helping the Yamashiro clan?

190
00:19:30,330 --> 00:19:34,210
Simple. He wants the 
gold mine for himself.

191
00:19:35,590 --> 00:19:40,600
Do you know how he found the 
mine before the government?

192
00:19:41,220 --> 00:19:43,760
Somebody gave him 
the information.

193
00:19:43,760 --> 00:19:47,350
Somebody who was the leader of 
the ninja of the Yamashiro clan.

194
00:19:48,600 --> 00:19:50,310
Himuro... Genma?!

195
00:19:51,810 --> 00:19:53,320
Precisely.

196
00:19:54,530 --> 00:19:57,990
I doubt that. He isn't 
in this world anymore.

197
00:19:58,570 --> 00:20:02,070
No, he's still very much alive. 
And you'll see him soon.

198
00:20:02,070 --> 00:20:05,330
Himuro Genma is the boss 
of the Kimon monsters.

199
00:20:05,330 --> 00:20:05,100
What?!

200
00:20:06,330 --> 00:20:08,410
Shh! Not so loud !

201
00:20:08,410 --> 00:20:10,460
You can't trick me 
the same way again!

202
00:20:10,460 --> 00:20:14,710
Don't be hasty. You'll 
soon know the truth.

203
00:20:14,710 --> 00:20:20,260
But you must admit that you 
and he share a strange fate.

204
00:20:25,810 --> 00:20:28,640
Stop! You'd kill 
your own friend?!

205
00:20:28,640 --> 00:20:32,100
The lord orders it! 
As did our leader!

206
00:20:33,610 --> 00:20:35,150
It's a trick!

207
00:20:35,150 --> 00:20:37,690
Now that we know the 
traitors' secret they want

208
00:20:37,690 --> 00:20:40,150
to get rid of us by making 
us kill each other.

209
00:20:40,570 --> 00:20:44,450
This is a trap for all of us. 
Shinkuro, believe me!

210
00:20:45,490 --> 00:20:47,160
Jubei... Forgive me.

211
00:20:47,540 --> 00:20:48,750
Shinkuro!

212
00:20:49,710 --> 00:20:51,040
His word...

213
00:20:51,460 --> 00:20:52,460
...is law!

214
00:21:31,750 --> 00:21:36,750
I avenged Shinkuro and the others myself. 
Genma can't be alive.

215
00:21:38,300 --> 00:21:42,340
We're getting close. This place 
is thick with ghosts and blood.

216
00:21:42,510 --> 00:21:44,970
Beyond lies Hell itself.

217
00:21:49,220 --> 00:21:53,230
Heaven must have sent 
this mist to help us.

218
00:22:08,410 --> 00:22:09,620
Hey!

219
00:22:17,790 --> 00:22:19,630
Double damned mist!

220
00:22:43,490 --> 00:22:46,990
How could he have 
dodged Shijima's claw?

221
00:23:15,350 --> 00:23:16,480
Who are you?

222
00:23:16,480 --> 00:23:19,900
I heard a voice 
chanting the sutra.

223
00:23:20,230 --> 00:23:23,440
I was praying for 
the dead villagers.

224
00:23:24,440 --> 00:23:28,200
Don't you know an epidemic 
plagues this village?

225
00:23:29,740 --> 00:23:34,540
Poor soul! You'll never 
leave this village alive.

226
00:23:34,830 --> 00:23:38,370
Here now, let us go to the 
land of Buddha together.

227
00:23:44,460 --> 00:23:48,010
Have you seen a 
traveling monk here?

228
00:23:49,050 --> 00:23:54,140
He'll meet Buddha soon enough. 
I'll send him there.

229
00:23:54,930 --> 00:23:56,600
Such a benevolent nun...

230
00:24:05,070 --> 00:24:06,900
Shit! Another cast-off skin!

231
00:24:17,500 --> 00:24:21,420
Gone... He uses a 
strange technique...

232
00:24:32,140 --> 00:24:34,350
As do you. Very strange indeed !

233
00:24:43,560 --> 00:24:50,360
Answer me. Are there any others 
with you besides the monk?

234
00:24:51,240 --> 00:24:54,740
Of course. And not 
just ten or twenty.

235
00:24:54,740 --> 00:24:57,100
You can send a snake for 
each and it won't be enough.

236
00:24:59,580 --> 00:25:00,830
Liar!

237
00:25:01,420 --> 00:25:04,210
All right! I'll 
tell you the truth.

238
00:25:05,290 --> 00:25:09,010
There's two. One's the traveling monk. 
The other...

239
00:25:09,130 --> 00:25:10,470
...is right behind you.

240
00:25:12,930 --> 00:25:15,760
Lose the snakes. Down 
to the last one!

241
00:25:21,980 --> 00:25:23,230
You'll be dead soon.

242
00:25:27,780 --> 00:25:28,780
Get rid of them!

243
00:25:47,250 --> 00:25:49,590
Now it's your turn to answer.

244
00:25:49,590 --> 00:25:52,420
What are you doing in this village? 
Talk!

245
00:26:10,990 --> 00:26:13,990
Twice failed. Unforgivable.

246
00:26:13,990 --> 00:26:17,990
I cast another line onto your 
neck, but you didn't notice.

247
00:26:17,990 --> 00:26:20,740
Ln the end, just a 
foolish amateur.

248
00:26:39,470 --> 00:26:41,430
Idiot! There's still time 
to suck the poison out!

249
00:26:42,980 --> 00:26:45,850
Poison doesn't work on me. 
My body's immune to it.

250
00:26:48,610 --> 00:26:51,110
I think I've cleared 
my debt to you.

251
00:26:51,110 --> 00:26:53,820
Yes. You saved me.

252
00:26:54,070 --> 00:26:58,320
Your name's Kagero, right? 
What are you going to do now?

253
00:26:58,320 --> 00:27:00,700
That's none of your concern.

254
00:27:01,620 --> 00:27:03,790
If it isn't, then what the 
hell am I doing here?!

255
00:27:05,160 --> 00:27:07,460
I have to discover their plan.

256
00:27:08,420 --> 00:27:10,630
By yourself? Impossible!

257
00:27:10,630 --> 00:27:12,800
They're too strong. 
Think this over.

258
00:27:13,300 --> 00:27:15,010
Stay out of my way.

259
00:27:15,010 --> 00:27:18,180
I've no reason to 
take orders from you.

260
00:27:21,850 --> 00:27:24,270
Hold a moment, Kunoichi of Koga.

261
00:27:24,270 --> 00:27:29,190
My name is Dakuan. Why 
don't you join me?

262
00:27:29,190 --> 00:27:32,980
This man is my 
trustworthy assistant.

263
00:27:33,480 --> 00:27:35,990
I wasn't planning on 
helping a government spy.

264
00:27:35,990 --> 00:27:38,160
Oh, quit complaining !

265
00:27:38,280 --> 00:27:39,530
What do you say, woman?

266
00:27:39,740 --> 00:27:44,200
Our aims may differ, but we 
three share a common enemy.

267
00:27:44,200 --> 00:27:47,160
And three is mightier than one.

268
00:27:47,160 --> 00:27:50,580
And I happen to have some 
information you don't know.

269
00:27:50,580 --> 00:27:53,630
Such as who is giving 
them their orders.

270
00:27:53,630 --> 00:27:55,710
I'll tell you on the way.

271
00:27:59,720 --> 00:28:00,840
I need no friends.

272
00:28:01,470 --> 00:28:05,350
But I may need your information.

273
00:28:05,350 --> 00:28:06,890
Very well.

274
00:28:13,070 --> 00:28:17,740
My, she's a lovely, sexy 
little thing, isn't she!

275
00:28:18,200 --> 00:28:21,030
What's running through that 
twisted skull of yours?

276
00:28:21,490 --> 00:28:25,240
Well now, that Kunoichi 
could prove very useful.

277
00:28:25,240 --> 00:28:29,040
She has a technique to poison 
the man she sleeps with.

278
00:28:29,580 --> 00:28:34,380
The big guy you killed had 
been poisoned by her.

279
00:29:20,220 --> 00:29:22,930
Your skill is as 
marvelous as ever.

280
00:29:22,930 --> 00:29:26,350
No... He was able to kill a 
mighty ninja like Tessai.

281
00:29:26,350 --> 00:29:30,390
Don't be off guard. It's 
possible he got away.

282
00:29:30,980 --> 00:29:33,230
The four of you 
will check it out.

283
00:29:33,230 --> 00:29:35,400
You're a cautious one, Yurimaru.

284
00:29:35,560 --> 00:29:40,650
We have an important mission. 
We take every precaution.

285
00:29:40,780 --> 00:29:42,610
I know, I know. Don't worry.

286
00:29:43,280 --> 00:29:44,910
Then go.

287
00:29:47,620 --> 00:29:51,100
Yurimaru, Benisato's death... 
How fortunate for you!

288
00:30:01,420 --> 00:30:03,630
Only things he killed 
were the fish.

289
00:30:03,630 --> 00:30:06,180
Good. Otherwise we 
wouldn't get our chance.

290
00:30:06,180 --> 00:30:08,430
It's getting quite 
interesting, isn't it?

291
00:30:23,240 --> 00:30:26,410
How is it? Just as we thought?

292
00:30:27,370 --> 00:30:30,290
They poisoned the wells 
and killed the villagers.

293
00:30:30,290 --> 00:30:32,370
And then blamed it on plague.

294
00:30:33,040 --> 00:30:36,290
A trick to keep the 
villagers away.

295
00:30:37,170 --> 00:30:41,960
They're planning something... 
quite extraordinary.

296
00:30:52,810 --> 00:30:55,350
I'd like to know what it is.

297
00:30:55,850 --> 00:30:58,900
That's fine, just don't get 
yourself involved too deeply.

298
00:30:58,900 --> 00:31:00,610
It could prove fatal.

299
00:31:22,250 --> 00:31:24,300
I see. Guide the others.

300
00:31:42,230 --> 00:31:43,440
Run for it!

301
00:32:05,550 --> 00:32:07,510
We can't outrun them.

302
00:32:09,380 --> 00:32:10,550
Kagero...

303
00:32:28,950 --> 00:32:31,570
So, the pollen is mixed 
with a sleeping potion.

304
00:32:31,570 --> 00:32:33,490
But how long will 
it hold them back?

305
00:32:34,580 --> 00:32:35,950
Why, you!

306
00:32:36,750 --> 00:32:37,750
Girl!

307
00:32:37,960 --> 00:32:40,290
You have to hold them off 
till Jubei kills him!

308
00:32:40,290 --> 00:32:42,250
Do whatever it takes!

309
00:32:56,520 --> 00:32:58,270
Call off your bees!

310
00:32:59,390 --> 00:33:01,980
I'm afraid you must 
beat me first.

311
00:33:03,980 --> 00:33:06,110
You don't know anything, do you?

312
00:33:06,110 --> 00:33:09,030
Do you think I ran in 
here to escape you?

313
00:33:09,610 --> 00:33:10,610
No, I don't.

314
00:33:10,610 --> 00:33:13,320
I have lots of questions for 
you, but no time to ask them.

315
00:33:13,620 --> 00:33:17,370
No, just one thing. Tell 
me, is Himuro Genma alive?

316
00:33:17,540 --> 00:33:19,250
So what if he is?

317
00:33:19,250 --> 00:33:21,920
I ask because I sent 
him to Hell before.

318
00:33:22,040 --> 00:33:24,710
Is that so? Then I'll 
have to be careful.

319
00:33:24,840 --> 00:33:29,300
Unlike Genma, I don't have the 
technique to reincarnate myself.

320
00:33:29,630 --> 00:33:30,920
Reincarnation?

321
00:33:39,680 --> 00:33:42,020
Fool! You've damaged the hive!

322
00:33:58,870 --> 00:34:01,620
The second you come up for 
air is the second you die!

323
00:34:04,500 --> 00:34:07,750
He's mine! Keep 
your hands off him!

324
00:34:08,040 --> 00:34:09,800
What about the 
Kunoichi and the monk?

325
00:34:09,800 --> 00:34:13,590
My bees should finish 
them off soon.

326
00:34:23,100 --> 00:34:26,810
How far is he trying to run? 
What a poor loser!

327
00:34:41,660 --> 00:34:44,460
Do you think he's fallen 
victim to the throat needle?

328
00:34:55,130 --> 00:34:59,760
No... The bees in the hive are 
trying to escape the water.

329
00:34:59,760 --> 00:35:04,100
Desperately stinging his body as 
they do so... Mushizo's lost.

330
00:35:15,780 --> 00:35:18,320
Took his time about it, but 
he finally killed him.

331
00:35:32,750 --> 00:35:38,340
Reincarnation? Did he mean Himuro 
Genma's come back to life?

332
00:35:39,390 --> 00:35:41,180
Impossible!

333
00:35:54,070 --> 00:35:57,990
Reincarnation? I've heard 
about the technique.

334
00:35:59,110 --> 00:36:04,370
You must control your flesh and 
blood down to the tiniest bones.

335
00:36:04,490 --> 00:36:10,290
If your limbs or even your head were 
cut off, you'd be able to rejoin them.

336
00:36:10,790 --> 00:36:14,000
Reincarnation... That's a 
technique of immortality.

337
00:36:14,000 --> 00:36:16,130
It can never be achieved 
by a human being.

338
00:36:16,550 --> 00:36:19,260
Well, well... That's 
a hell of a trick!

339
00:36:19,260 --> 00:36:23,720
Anyway, the Kimon monsters 
are now all after you.

340
00:36:23,720 --> 00:36:26,020
That means I can move easily.

341
00:36:28,980 --> 00:36:31,400
If you're lucky, 
we'll meet again.

342
00:36:34,270 --> 00:36:36,610
Why did you join him?

343
00:36:37,240 --> 00:36:40,410
He hired me... For 100 ryo.

344
00:36:40,610 --> 00:36:43,490
You're a mercenary ninja? One 
who'd do anything for money?

345
00:36:44,370 --> 00:36:46,240
You could say that.

346
00:36:46,240 --> 00:36:50,290
But he suckered me into it. 
Trapped me.

347
00:36:50,920 --> 00:36:53,750
I'll die of his 
poison in half a day.

348
00:36:55,050 --> 00:36:58,880
He promised me an antidote 
along with the gold.

349
00:36:58,880 --> 00:37:03,010
That's why I work for him. 
I can't back out now.

350
00:37:03,350 --> 00:37:06,430
You'd better run for it while 
I divert their attention.

351
00:37:07,100 --> 00:37:10,270
I can't do that. I'd 
owe you another debt.

352
00:37:10,730 --> 00:37:12,230
Forget about any debts.

353
00:37:12,230 --> 00:37:15,610
And I told you I don't have 
to take orders from you.

354
00:37:15,610 --> 00:37:18,150
Besides, I'm ready 
to die any moment.

355
00:37:18,240 --> 00:37:20,200
Relax. Stop pretending 
you're so tough.

356
00:37:20,200 --> 00:37:21,450
What?!

357
00:37:22,910 --> 00:37:25,240
It's this humid weather!

358
00:37:25,240 --> 00:37:29,700
I wish a storm would come and 
cool off that hot head of yours.

359
00:37:33,880 --> 00:37:35,920
You're in no position 
to worry about me.

360
00:37:42,470 --> 00:37:43,720
Storm...

361
00:37:45,760 --> 00:37:49,980
They came on the night 
of that big storm...

362
00:37:54,560 --> 00:37:57,440
Hey, where can I get a 
good look at this area?

363
00:38:04,030 --> 00:38:05,410
How about there?

364
00:38:05,410 --> 00:38:06,660
Nothing.

365
00:38:06,660 --> 00:38:08,330
Keep looking !

366
00:38:21,300 --> 00:38:22,300
Hanza...

367
00:38:22,300 --> 00:38:23,010
Wait!

368
00:38:24,090 --> 00:38:24,800
Hanza!

369
00:38:29,760 --> 00:38:32,430
There's a cliff in front of you! 
Stop!

370
00:38:33,390 --> 00:38:34,480
Damn!

371
00:38:48,490 --> 00:38:49,620
Gotcha!

372
00:38:49,620 --> 00:38:50,120
Shit!

373
00:38:58,540 --> 00:39:02,800
Fool! They got you so soon? 
We still had a lot to do.

374
00:39:08,140 --> 00:39:11,140
The scent of blasted flesh, 
grilled to perfection...

375
00:39:11,140 --> 00:39:13,060
Such a lovely smell.

376
00:39:37,790 --> 00:39:39,170
Don't... move...

377
00:39:39,460 --> 00:39:41,630
That's enough. Let me go.

378
00:39:41,630 --> 00:39:43,670
It's my fault I fell 
for their trap.

379
00:39:44,050 --> 00:39:45,720
Shut up! Don't talk!

380
00:39:46,720 --> 00:39:49,010
Let go of me! I don't 
want your help.

381
00:39:49,340 --> 00:39:50,970
Shut up!

382
00:39:59,100 --> 00:40:01,820
Go on, grab it!

383
00:40:14,290 --> 00:40:17,210
Just gonna hang onto me all day?

384
00:40:34,140 --> 00:40:39,020
I am Utsutsu Mujuro. I've been 
longing to challenge you.

385
00:40:45,530 --> 00:40:47,940
He's here for me. Stay here.

386
00:41:00,790 --> 00:41:05,130
You lured me here because I'm blind? 
Is that your plan?

387
00:41:19,600 --> 00:41:22,190
If you want to kill me, 
then don't make a sound.

388
00:41:23,350 --> 00:41:27,190
That's impossible. But maybe I can 
turn your skill to my advantage.

389
00:42:02,480 --> 00:42:03,980
I told you to stay back!

390
00:42:10,900 --> 00:42:13,150
Your sight is your weakness.

391
00:42:16,820 --> 00:42:17,580
Outta the way!

392
00:42:30,170 --> 00:42:31,130
Impossible...

393
00:43:16,300 --> 00:43:19,600
The cargo from the ship that ran 
aground in the storm two days ago.

394
00:43:19,600 --> 00:43:21,720
That's what they're after.

395
00:43:21,720 --> 00:43:25,060
They butchered the villagers 
like animals for it.

396
00:43:38,740 --> 00:43:40,910
Where does this road lead?

397
00:43:46,100 --> 00:43:48,080
Chamberlain!

398
00:43:48,920 --> 00:43:50,340
Lord Hyobu, is it true?

399
00:43:50,340 --> 00:43:55,880
That the Koga ninja who went to investigate 
Shimoda Village were wiped out?

400
00:43:56,130 --> 00:43:57,470
Exactly.

401
00:43:57,470 --> 00:44:01,300
But how?! This is an emergency.

402
00:44:01,300 --> 00:44:03,600
I'll take my men to the 
village immediately.

403
00:44:03,770 --> 00:44:04,930
No!

404
00:44:04,930 --> 00:44:08,140
If this is serious 
enough to jeopardize the

405
00:44:08,140 --> 00:44:11,690
safety of our clan, we 
must move very carefully.

406
00:44:12,440 --> 00:44:14,860
That's how small clans 
like ours survive.

407
00:44:14,860 --> 00:44:15,900
But...

408
00:44:16,240 --> 00:44:19,700
The Kunoichi who survived is 
continuing the investigation.

409
00:44:19,820 --> 00:44:21,740
Wait for her report.

410
00:45:21,840 --> 00:45:25,640
Those wheel tracks lead 
to Kashima Harbor.

411
00:45:25,640 --> 00:45:28,180
They're probably going to 
transport the cargo out by boat.

412
00:45:28,520 --> 00:45:29,060
If I don't stop them...

413
00:45:29,060 --> 00:45:32,980
those dead villagers and the Koga 
ninja will never rest in peace.

414
00:45:39,530 --> 00:45:43,570
Listen well, you who labor 
for the Shogun of the Dark.

415
00:45:43,570 --> 00:45:47,120
This mission could very 
well decide our fate!

416
00:45:47,410 --> 00:45:50,500
This ship will reach 
Mochizuki in a few hours.

417
00:45:50,500 --> 00:45:53,620
We must retrieve the 
cargo at any cost!

418
00:45:53,920 --> 00:45:56,250
Understood? At any cost!

419
00:46:16,020 --> 00:46:18,610
The towns must have cleared out 
out of fear of the epidemic.

420
00:46:19,440 --> 00:46:22,360
One horse was enough to 
scare them all away.

421
00:46:27,070 --> 00:46:30,290
So, you're still alive. 
I've been worried.

422
00:46:31,080 --> 00:46:33,290
It's nice to see you, too.

423
00:46:33,540 --> 00:46:36,830
They're waiting for a boat 
to transport the cargo.

424
00:46:37,380 --> 00:46:39,340
Did you check what the cargo is?

425
00:46:39,460 --> 00:46:44,220
No, I couldn't reach it. But 
I can guess what it is.

426
00:46:44,220 --> 00:46:46,300
Actually, I guessed before 
I came to Mochizuki.

427
00:46:46,840 --> 00:46:47,850
What?!

428
00:46:47,850 --> 00:46:49,970
You haven't figured it out?

429
00:46:49,180 --> 00:46:52,520
It's something that has 
to do with your past.

430
00:46:53,430 --> 00:46:55,440
It's gold, boy.

431
00:46:55,440 --> 00:46:59,150
Gold produced from that 
secret Yamashiro mine.

432
00:47:01,070 --> 00:47:03,240
The ship ran aground 
during the storm...

433
00:47:03,240 --> 00:47:07,410
Probably on its way to the Shogun 
of the Dark with caskets of gold.

434
00:47:07,570 --> 00:47:11,910
Gold that's probably been 
hidden for the last five years.

435
00:47:12,160 --> 00:47:14,370
If it reaches his hands,

436
00:47:14,370 --> 00:47:17,040
he'll be powerful enough to 
topple the Tokugawa government...

437
00:47:17,040 --> 00:47:19,210
...and plunge the country 
into another civil war.

438
00:47:19,420 --> 00:47:21,460
We have to stop it at any cost!

439
00:47:25,880 --> 00:47:28,510
Dakuan, you've got a tail.

440
00:47:28,510 --> 00:47:29,260
What?!

441
00:47:39,810 --> 00:47:41,690
Kunoichi, what are you doing?!

442
00:47:42,020 --> 00:47:45,440
I'm calling a Koga ninja 
bird that's in this village.

443
00:47:46,070 --> 00:47:47,530
Calling a bird? What for?

444
00:47:48,030 --> 00:47:50,620
It'll carry my message to 
the castle chamberlain.

445
00:47:50,870 --> 00:47:52,870
I've discovered 
what they're after.

446
00:47:52,870 --> 00:47:56,660
Ln two hours, his army 
will surround the town.

447
00:47:57,080 --> 00:47:58,670
It's not as easy as you think.

448
00:47:59,000 --> 00:48:02,130
The Mochizuki clan will probably 
ignore this whole thing.

449
00:48:02,590 --> 00:48:03,130
Why?!

450
00:48:07,880 --> 00:48:09,720
The future of the 
clan is at stake.

451
00:48:09,720 --> 00:48:12,810
This is a power struggle between the 
Tokugawa and the Shogun of the Dark.

452
00:48:12,810 --> 00:48:17,020
If a small clan like the Mochizuki 
got involved, it'd be smashed !

453
00:48:20,150 --> 00:48:23,690
See nothing, hear nothing. That's 
the best course for the clan.

454
00:48:35,410 --> 00:48:37,960
We'll find out soon whether or 
not the Mochizuki will move.

455
00:48:59,640 --> 00:49:00,520
Shit!

456
00:49:01,520 --> 00:49:02,270
Uh-oh!

457
00:49:22,790 --> 00:49:24,000
Kunoichi in Custody

458
00:49:24,000 --> 00:49:28,760
Kunoichi in Custody It must have 
happened when I went off for a moment.

459
00:49:28,760 --> 00:49:29,630
Kunoichi in Custody

460
00:49:30,090 --> 00:49:33,050
She's most likely dead.

461
00:49:33,930 --> 00:49:36,970
Well, we've got work to do.

462
00:49:36,970 --> 00:49:39,430
We'll get no help from 
the Mochizuki clan.

463
00:49:43,020 --> 00:49:45,400
Don't fall for their trap.

464
00:49:45,820 --> 00:49:46,650
Wait!

465
00:49:47,980 --> 00:49:50,570
What if their ship comes 
while you're at it?

466
00:49:50,570 --> 00:49:54,070
Let her alone! A dead Kunoichi 
isn't that important!

467
00:49:55,070 --> 00:49:56,950
Not important compared 
to the great mission?

468
00:49:56,950 --> 00:49:58,950
You're as much of a 
monster as they are!

469
00:49:58,950 --> 00:50:03,580
Fool! When you fight monsters, you 
become one yourself or you can't win!

470
00:50:05,040 --> 00:50:09,590
You damn fool boy! Go ahead ! 
GO TO HELL!

471
00:50:09,590 --> 00:50:12,930
Damn you... !

472
00:50:56,340 --> 00:50:57,140
Are you all right?

473
00:50:59,720 --> 00:51:00,430
Kagero!

474
00:51:19,580 --> 00:51:23,450
You're hard to kill, but... 
Woman, release his pain.

475
00:51:46,480 --> 00:51:48,810
Kibagami Jubei?

476
00:51:49,150 --> 00:51:52,150
Yes. But we've already 
killed them all.

477
00:51:52,150 --> 00:51:54,900
Idiot! They still live.

478
00:51:56,240 --> 00:51:57,660
I'll kill him, for sure!

479
00:51:57,660 --> 00:52:02,120
Stay where you are. Lure 
them there and kill them.

480
00:52:02,410 --> 00:52:03,660
Understand?

481
00:52:03,660 --> 00:52:04,120
Yes.

482
00:52:10,330 --> 00:52:12,800
Never would I have 
imagined to see him here.

483
00:52:13,000 --> 00:52:15,550
I look forward to seeing 
you again, Jubei.

484
00:52:17,300 --> 00:52:18,800
Genma!

485
00:52:23,850 --> 00:52:25,180
I'm sorry.

486
00:52:26,100 --> 00:52:30,150
Forget it. I take it the castle 
retainers haven't taken any action?

487
00:52:31,650 --> 00:52:34,020
It's been two hours.

488
00:52:34,610 --> 00:52:36,030
I see.

489
00:52:39,950 --> 00:52:43,660
Why... You knew it was a trap, 
but you came to help me.

490
00:52:43,660 --> 00:52:47,080
It was stupid. Why 
risk your life for me?

491
00:52:47,080 --> 00:52:49,040
Because I can't just 
toss aside my comrade.

492
00:52:49,160 --> 00:52:49,920
Comrade?

493
00:52:50,620 --> 00:52:54,800
Yes. We've saved each other 
over and over since yesterday.

494
00:52:54,800 --> 00:52:56,170
You're a precious friend to me.

495
00:53:05,430 --> 00:53:06,180
Stay!

496
00:53:06,720 --> 00:53:09,350
The Mochizuki clan is 
staying out of this one.

497
00:53:09,350 --> 00:53:11,190
Your mission is over.

498
00:53:11,560 --> 00:53:14,940
No, it isn't. I'm 
still in debt to you.

499
00:53:16,690 --> 00:53:18,280
You can pay it back later.

500
00:53:19,150 --> 00:53:21,360
Not if you're dead !

501
00:53:21,490 --> 00:53:23,280
I'll repay it here!

502
00:53:33,330 --> 00:53:35,040
What are you doing?

503
00:53:41,220 --> 00:53:44,680
The old man told me how 
to counteract the poison.

504
00:53:45,970 --> 00:53:47,770
"Kill poison with poison."

505
00:53:48,140 --> 00:53:52,440
He said if you make love to a 
poison-taster like me, you'll be cured.

506
00:53:55,110 --> 00:53:56,650
Take me...

507
00:54:52,910 --> 00:54:55,750
We've been waiting ! Load 
the ship immediately!

508
00:55:22,570 --> 00:55:25,860
You! Well, I warned 
you, didn't I?

509
00:55:25,860 --> 00:55:29,120
We've lost. We'll never 
beat that many men.

510
00:55:29,620 --> 00:55:33,700
I don't intend to let them go. 
We'll make our stand soon.

511
00:55:34,580 --> 00:55:35,830
What are you planning?

512
00:55:35,100 --> 00:55:38,830
When they finish 
loading the gold...

513
00:55:38,830 --> 00:55:40,750
...go to the tower 
and ring the bell.

514
00:55:41,050 --> 00:55:44,260
While they're distracted, 
I'll sneak onboard the ship.

515
00:55:44,510 --> 00:55:47,380
When we're out at sea, 
we won't need any storm.

516
00:55:47,380 --> 00:55:49,140
I'll sink it myself.

517
00:55:49,260 --> 00:55:50,140
Very well.

518
00:55:51,010 --> 00:55:54,730
By the way, did you make 
love to that Kunoichi?

519
00:55:56,270 --> 00:56:00,190
None of your damn business! 
Now get going !

520
00:56:22,420 --> 00:56:25,130
Genma... Where are you?

521
00:56:25,260 --> 00:56:28,510
When I die, I'll take 
you to hell with me!

522
00:57:00,710 --> 00:57:03,170
The Mochizuki clan?! They're 
moving against them!

523
00:57:08,590 --> 00:57:10,720
Ah, Kunoichi! You've 
done a fine job.

524
00:57:11,090 --> 00:57:13,140
Hurry, before they get away! 
Where are the others?

525
00:57:14,640 --> 00:57:17,470
Don't worry. They've got 
this place surrounded.

526
00:57:18,020 --> 00:57:19,890
Then hurry!

527
00:57:38,290 --> 00:57:40,120
Jubei...

528
00:57:48,130 --> 00:57:49,720
Kagero!

529
00:57:51,260 --> 00:57:52,590
Stop! It's a trap!

530
00:57:53,390 --> 00:57:57,720
Fool! Sakaki Hyobu 
died two days ago.

531
00:58:11,780 --> 00:58:13,610
I killed him personally.

532
00:58:14,110 --> 00:58:16,870
Genma!

533
00:58:40,350 --> 00:58:43,770
Sir, please get aboard 
the ship quickly.

534
00:58:43,770 --> 00:58:47,360
The retainers of the Shogun 
of the Dark are waiting.

535
00:58:48,190 --> 00:58:52,400
Leave Jubei to me. Upon my 
honor, I will not fail.

536
00:58:53,360 --> 00:58:56,700
Please grant me this one wish.

537
00:59:00,990 --> 00:59:02,790
Very well then. Go.

538
00:59:30,770 --> 00:59:34,740
Stay out of this. Don't shame me 
any more than you already have.

539
00:59:37,240 --> 00:59:38,870
So, you are Genma?

540
00:59:39,410 --> 00:59:42,910
The Mochizuki clan 
suspects nothing, correct?

541
00:59:42,910 --> 00:59:44,910
Yes. All is well.

542
00:59:44,910 --> 00:59:49,330
You've done a splendid job. I 
admire you Devils of Kimon.

543
00:59:49,420 --> 00:59:52,460
The Shogun of the 
Dark will be pleased.

544
01:00:25,620 --> 01:00:27,660
Writhe in pain before you die.

545
01:01:03,620 --> 01:01:06,620
Yurimaru seems to have 
suffered some ill fortune!

546
01:01:06,620 --> 01:01:09,100
How careless of him to 
have fallen into my trap.

547
01:01:11,460 --> 01:01:13,920
It was your own fault, Yurimaru.

548
01:01:17,670 --> 01:01:18,720
Let's go.

549
01:01:21,800 --> 01:01:22,800
Kagero!

550
01:01:32,650 --> 01:01:34,820
Hang on! Kagero!

551
01:01:38,690 --> 01:01:39,990
Jubei...

552
01:01:40,490 --> 01:01:41,820
I told you not to come.

553
01:01:43,280 --> 01:01:46,990
I wanted... to apologize...

554
01:01:50,500 --> 01:01:52,920
It was the first time...

555
01:01:52,920 --> 01:01:56,670
You didn't treat me like 
some poison-taster...

556
01:01:56,670 --> 01:01:59,840
...but like a normal woman.

557
01:02:52,060 --> 01:02:57,730
Jubei... I'm glad... 
I met you...

558
01:04:32,120 --> 01:04:37,750
Genma, with the gold's help our 
dream will soon be reality.

559
01:04:37,750 --> 01:04:38,790
"Our" dream?

560
01:04:38,790 --> 01:04:44,710
Our great dream to topple the Shogunate 
and restore the reign of the Toyotomi.

561
01:04:44,920 --> 01:04:46,840
You don't understand...

562
01:04:46,840 --> 01:04:50,430
How we, the former retainers 
of Toyotomi, have suffered.

563
01:04:50,760 --> 01:04:54,350
Now it'll be the Tokugawa who 
suffer the agony and torment.

564
01:04:54,350 --> 01:05:00,150
We'll use the gold to buy advanced weapons 
from Spain and defeat the Tokugawa.

565
01:05:00,150 --> 01:05:04,650
That is the dream of all of us who 
work for the Shogun of the Dark.

566
01:05:05,480 --> 01:05:06,650
Nonsense.

567
01:05:08,360 --> 01:05:09,610
What did you say?!

568
01:05:09,820 --> 01:05:11,570
I said nonsense.

569
01:05:11,570 --> 01:05:14,660
Hold your tongue! 
You're a mere ninja!

570
01:05:14,660 --> 01:05:16,620
My dream is different.

571
01:05:16,620 --> 01:05:19,580
The gold isn't going to 
the Shogun of the Dark.

572
01:05:19,580 --> 01:05:20,330
What?!

573
01:05:20,330 --> 01:05:22,540
We, the Devils of Kimon, 
will take the gold.

574
01:05:22,670 --> 01:05:24,210
You impudent... !

575
01:05:26,210 --> 01:05:30,550
I'll use it to organize the most 
powerful army of ninja ever.

576
01:05:30,550 --> 01:05:35,180
And we'll rule the country with 
terror and power from the shadows.

577
01:05:35,470 --> 01:05:38,430
Anyone who opposes me, 
Tokugawa or Toyotomi...

578
01:05:38,430 --> 01:05:41,480
...even the Shogun of the 
Dark himself, shall die.

579
01:05:42,900 --> 01:05:47,070
Meaning the true Shogun of the Dark... 
will be me.

580
01:06:04,540 --> 01:06:10,380
Well now, you're here! I was 
just wishing you'd come.

581
01:06:10,380 --> 01:06:11,470
I'm glad to hear that.

582
01:06:11,970 --> 01:06:13,640
Of course.

583
01:06:13,640 --> 01:06:19,140
Without your help, sinking a big 
ship like this would be impossible!

584
01:06:25,520 --> 01:06:26,610
Pathetic old fool!

585
01:06:28,230 --> 01:06:29,110
Over here.

586
01:06:39,790 --> 01:06:40,750
What's wrong?

587
01:06:41,580 --> 01:06:44,620
Fire in the hold ! 
We're gonna sink!

588
01:06:44,750 --> 01:06:46,460
Idiot! Put out the fire!

589
01:06:46,580 --> 01:06:48,670
Impossible! It's a sea of flame!

590
01:06:48,800 --> 01:06:51,420
Put it out! Fight it!

591
01:06:51,550 --> 01:06:53,550
Move it! Move it!

592
01:06:53,930 --> 01:06:55,390
Forget it! Run!

593
01:07:04,310 --> 01:07:05,060
Master Genma!

594
01:07:06,230 --> 01:07:07,690
Pass this message to everyone:

595
01:07:07,810 --> 01:07:12,990
"Abandon ship and hide yourselves. 
I'll call for you someday."

596
01:07:12,990 --> 01:07:13,990
Go.

597
01:07:53,610 --> 01:07:54,610
Genma!

598
01:07:56,860 --> 01:07:59,950
I see you brought back some 
devils from your trip to Hell.

599
01:08:08,960 --> 01:08:10,790
Kibagami Jubei...

600
01:08:10,920 --> 01:08:14,260
I should've finished 
you with my own hands.

601
01:08:14,550 --> 01:08:17,220
Stop your whining. 
It's too late.

602
01:08:19,090 --> 01:08:22,600
You want to avenge 
the Kunoichi Kagero?

603
01:08:22,810 --> 01:08:26,020
She was trash in comparison 
to what I've lost.

604
01:08:30,060 --> 01:08:31,820
You alone I can't forgive!

605
01:09:22,490 --> 01:09:25,830
I won't kill you yet. Not 
before I make you suffer.

606
01:09:26,160 --> 01:09:28,410
I'll make you pay for 
smashing my dream.

607
01:09:28,620 --> 01:09:33,420
Your dream? That you were going to 
be the true Shogun of the Dark?

608
01:09:34,380 --> 01:09:35,840
Don't make me laugh.

609
01:09:36,340 --> 01:09:41,380
If you became shogun, you'd 
make this a world of devils.

610
01:09:42,050 --> 01:09:46,810
If you enjoy their company so much... 
then go back to hell!

611
01:10:04,030 --> 01:10:05,620
I'll kill you!

612
01:10:08,950 --> 01:10:11,040
No one can kill me.

613
01:10:15,460 --> 01:10:18,340
You of all people 
should know by now...

614
01:10:21,260 --> 01:10:24,090
I am immortal.

615
01:10:27,260 --> 01:10:28,640
Is that so?

616
01:10:40,900 --> 01:10:44,410
If you keep coming 
back to life...

617
01:10:44,950 --> 01:10:48,700
...then I'll kill you as 
many times as it takes!

618
01:12:00,570 --> 01:12:02,110
You fool!

619
01:12:47,490 --> 01:12:50,570
Genma! HERE YOU DIE!

620
01:13:49,010 --> 01:13:50,380
Jubei!

621
01:13:50,380 --> 01:13:54,760
You seem to be rid of the 
poison, thanks to Kagero.

622
01:13:54,930 --> 01:13:59,350
The combination of a poison-tasting 
Kunoichi and a talented lone wolf

623
01:13:59,350 --> 01:14:01,690
worked out even better 
than I had planned.

624
01:14:01,890 --> 01:14:03,270
Go away.

625
01:14:07,860 --> 01:14:12,570
By the way, I'm sorry about losing Kagero. 
A real pity, that!

626
01:14:12,660 --> 01:14:15,910
But for a scant few 
moments, she was able to

627
01:14:15,910 --> 01:14:19,080
be an ordinary girl and 
make love with you.

628
01:14:19,910 --> 01:14:21,910
Was that part of your plan, too?

629
01:14:21,910 --> 01:14:27,090
Exactly. To read and control peoples' 
hearts is the true secret of the ninja.

630
01:14:28,750 --> 01:14:33,380
Still, only true sincerity 
can move the human heart.

631
01:14:33,380 --> 01:14:36,260
A twisted old bastard 
like me couldn't do it.

632
01:14:36,390 --> 01:14:40,140
You're a hell of a guy. 
I really admire you.

633
01:14:40,140 --> 01:14:43,140
As promised, I'll be waiting 
in Edo with your 100 ryo.

634
01:14:43,140 --> 01:14:45,060
Come and get it, if 
you're still alive.

635
01:14:51,900 --> 01:14:55,410
That makes us even. Now 
never cross my path again.

636
01:14:56,410 --> 01:15:00,120
You've beaten me. I thought I'd 
shut your mouth in Edo, but...

637
01:15:00,120 --> 01:15:04,170
Still, in your condition you likely 
won't even make it to the shore.

638
01:15:04,170 --> 01:15:06,880
Everything will end 
just as I planned.
